#: ../../user/changelog.md:1
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "変更履歴"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:4
msgid ""
"All ten `@rescript-tauri/*` packages are published on npm; the current "
"release is `0.1.3` (`plugin-notification` is at `0.2.0`). Each package "
"keeps its own canonical changelog under `packages/<name>/CHANGELOG.md`; "
"this page collects the highlights across all of them."
msgstr ""
"`@rescript-tauri/*` の全 10 パッケージは npm で公開済みで、現在のリリースは `0.1.3` です（`plugin-"
"notification` のみ `0.2.0`）。各パッケージは正本となる変更履歴を "
"`packages/<name>/CHANGELOG.md` に保持しており、本ページは全パッケージのハイライトを集約したものです。"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:11
msgid "0.1.3 / `plugin-notification` 0.2.0 (2026-10-14)"
msgstr "0.1.3 / `plugin-notification` 0.2.0（2026-10-14）"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:13
msgid ""
"Catch-up with Tauri 2.12 (`@tauri-apps/api` 2.12.3 and the matching "
"plugin releases). `core`, `plugin-fs` and `plugin-shell` ship as `0.1.3`;"
" `plugin-notification` ships as `0.2.0` because of its breaking change."
msgstr ""
"Tauri 2.12 への追従（`@tauri-apps/api` 2.12.3 と対応する各 plugin リリース）。`core` / "
"`plugin-fs` / `plugin-shell` は `0.1.3`、破壊的変更を含む `plugin-notification` は "
"`0.2.0` として公開します。"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:18
msgid ""
"`core`: `App.exit`, `Window.setFullscreenOnMonitor`, the "
"`#liquidGlassRegular` / `#liquidGlassClear` effect styles with "
"`effects.interactive`, and `noRedirectionBitmap` on `Window.options` / "
"`WebviewWindow.options`."
msgstr ""
"`core`: `App.exit`、`Window.setFullscreenOnMonitor`、effect style の "
"`#liquidGlassRegular` / `#liquidGlassClear` と "
"`effects.interactive`、`Window.options` / `WebviewWindow.options` の "
"`noRedirectionBitmap` を追加。"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:22
msgid ""
"`plugin-fs`: `size` accepts `~options` with `baseDir`; the upstream peer "
"is now `@tauri-apps/plugin-fs ^2.6.0`."
msgstr ""
"`plugin-fs`: `size` が `baseDir` を持つ `~options` を受け取るように変更。上流 peer は "
"`@tauri-apps/plugin-fs ^2.6.0` に引き上げ。"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:24
msgid ""
"`plugin-shell`: `spawnOptions.processGroup`; the upstream peer is now "
"`@tauri-apps/plugin-shell ^2.5.0`."
msgstr ""
"`plugin-shell`: `spawnOptions.processGroup` を追加。上流 peer は `@tauri-apps"
"/plugin-shell ^2.5.0` に引き上げ。"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:26
msgid ""
"`plugin-notification`: **breaking** — the `onAction` callback receives an"
" `actionPerformed` record instead of `options`; the upstream peer is now "
"`@tauri-apps/plugin-notification ^2.6.0`."
msgstr ""
"`plugin-notification`: **破壊的変更** — `onAction` のコールバックが `options` ではなく "
"`actionPerformed` レコードを受け取るように変更。上流 peer は `@tauri-apps/plugin-"
"notification ^2.6.0` に引き上げ。"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:30
msgid "Maintenance releases"
msgstr "メンテナンスリリース"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:32
msgid ""
"Patch releases that only refresh development dependencies. The published "
"artifacts (compiled `.mjs`, `.res` / `.resi` sources) are unaffected, and"
" no API changes are involved."
msgstr ""
"開発用依存関係の更新のみを行うパッチリリースです。公開物（コンパイル済み `.mjs`、`.res` / `.resi` "
"ソース）に影響はなく、API の変更も含みません。"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:36
msgid "0.1.3 (2026-10-14)"
msgstr "0.1.3（2026-10-14）"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:38
msgid ""
"`plugin-dialog`, `plugin-log`, `plugin-os`, `plugin-clipboard-manager`, "
"`plugin-http` and `schema`. Development dependencies bumped to vitest "
"5.0.3, @vitest/coverage-v8 5.0.3, @types/node 26.6.4, and the latest "
"upstream `@tauri-apps/plugin-*` releases."
msgstr ""
"`plugin-dialog` / `plugin-log` / `plugin-os` / `plugin-clipboard-manager`"
" / `plugin-http` / `schema` が対象。開発依存を vitest 5.0.3、@vitest/coverage-v8 "
"5.0.3、@types/node 26.6.4、および上流 `@tauri-apps/plugin-*` の最新リリースに更新しました。"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:44
msgid "0.1.2 (2026-08-30)"
msgstr "0.1.2（2026-08-30）"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:46
msgid ""
"All ten packages. Development dependencies bumped to vitest 4.1.11, "
"@vitest/coverage-v8 4.1.11, happy-dom 20.11.13, @types/node 26.4.0, "
"rescript 12.3.1; `core` also tracks @tauri-apps/api 2.11.1, `plugin-"
"dialog` @tauri-apps/plugin-dialog 2.7.2, and `plugin-log` @tauri-apps"
"/plugin-log 2.9.0."
msgstr ""
"全 10 パッケージ。開発用依存関係を vitest 4.1.11、@vitest/coverage-v8 4.1.11、happy-dom "
"20.11.13、@types/node 26.4.0、rescript 12.3.1 に更新しました。加えて `core` は @tauri-"
"apps/api 2.11.1、`plugin-dialog` は @tauri-apps/plugin-dialog 2.7.2"
"、`plugin-log` は @tauri-apps/plugin-log 2.9.0 に追従しています。"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:52
msgid "0.1.1 (2026-06-10)"
msgstr "0.1.1（2026-06-10）"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:54
msgid ""
"All ten packages. Development dependencies bumped to ReScript 12.3, "
"@rescript/core 1.6.1, vitest 4.1.8, @vitest/coverage-v8 4.1.8, happy-dom "
